  "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">这是一个FORGE客户端模组！！！</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本模组将1.4.2快照12w36a中的信标带回来了。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本模组还增加了不同的效果，可通过在信标旁放置方块来应用：</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 玻璃 | 显示效果检测区域 <strong>必须放在信标顶部（1.18.1版本已移除）</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 命令方块 | 调试偏移</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 紫珀块 | 淡出效果</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 石英块 | 旋转光柱</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 黑曜石 | 彩虹颜色</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 红石块 | 移除一条光柱</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 黏液块 | 增加一条光柱</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 侦测器 | 添加纹理</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 海晶灯 | 使信标光柱旋转</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 海晶石 | 使光柱更不透明</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 青金石块 | 在x和z轴上偏移1格</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 煤炭块 | 在x和z轴上偏移-1格</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 末地石 | 魔法效果 | 仅限1.15.2和1.16.1版本 | V 1.1</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;- 涂蜡铜块 | 激光效果 <strong>（1.18.1版本新增）</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">视频说明可在此查看：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fJIhTT2e5q6o\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/JIhTT2e5q6o</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">您可以在任何模组包中使用此模组，但请注明我的功劳。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">您可以制作关于此模组的YouTube视频，但请注明我的功劳。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">最新源代码现已发布在github上！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AlexDorian7/BetterBeaconEffects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/AlexDorian7/BetterBeaconEffects</a></span></p>",
